  "description": {
    "en": "Luxilon Element is one of the softest and most comfortable polyester strings in the Luxilon lineup. Its Multi-Mono Technology enhances touch, feel and ball pocketing while reducing the harsh vibrations often associated with traditional polyester strings. Designed for players with long, fast swings, Element combines remarkable precision and spin with a softer, more forgiving response. The 1.25 mm version emphasizes feel and control, while the 1.30 mm version provides greater durability and stability.",

    "zh": "Luxilon Element 是 Luxilon 产品线中最柔和、最舒适的聚酯球线之一。其 Multi-Mono Technology 能够提升触球感、持球感与击球反馈，同时减少传统聚酯球线常见的生硬震动。它非常适合挥拍幅度大、速度快，但又不喜欢硬聚酯手感的球员，在保持精准控制和旋转能力的同时提供更柔和、更宽容的反馈。1.25毫米版本更强调手感与控制；1.30毫米版本则更强调耐久性和稳定性。"
  },

